  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rail Maintenance, Safety and Efficiency Reverse Trade Mission (RTM), through The Webster Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This USTDA-funded reverse trade mission (RTM) supports U.S. private sector participation in the development of rail safety, maintenance and efficiency infrastructure in India and Bangladesh. The RTM supports USTDA&apos;s goal of developing freight rail infrastructure in emerging markets and the Governments of India and Bangladesh&apos;s intent to improve and expand rail infrastructure. The RTM will share best practices for value-based rail infrastructure planning and support opportunities for U.S. rail exports to India and Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
